{
  "title": "Limits5.2",
  "notes": [
    "<h2>Limits and Continuity — Exercise 15.2</h2>",
    "<h3>Evaluate the following</h3>",

    "<h4>1) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin ax}{x}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Multiplying and dividing by $a$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin ax}{ax} \\times a$$",
    "$$= 1 \\times a = a$$",

    "<h4>2) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\tan bx}{x}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Writing $\\tan bx = \\dfrac{\\sin bx}{\\cos bx}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin bx}{\\cos bx} \\times \\frac{1}{x}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin bx}{bx} \\times bx \\times \\frac{1}{x} \\times \\frac{1}{\\cos bx}$$",
    "$$= 1 \\cdot b \\cdot 1 = b$$",

    "<h4>3) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin mx}{\\sin nx}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Multiplying and dividing to form standard limits:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin mx}{mx} \\times mx \\times \\frac{1}{\\sin nx} \\times \\frac{nx}{nx}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin mx}{mx} \\times \\frac{nx}{\\sin nx} \\times \\frac{mx}{nx}$$",
    "$$= 1 \\cdot 1 \\times \\frac{m}{n} = \\frac{m}{n}$$",

    "<h4>4) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\tan ax}{\\tan bx}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Writing $\\tan ax = \\dfrac{\\sin ax}{\\cos ax}$ and $\\tan bx = \\dfrac{\\sin bx}{\\cos bx}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\tan ax \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{1}{\\tan bx}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin ax}{\\cos ax} \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\cos bx}{\\sin bx}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin ax}{ax} \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{1}{\\cos ax} \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\cos bx \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{bx}{\\sin bx} \\cdot \\frac{ax}{bx}$$",
    "$$= 1 \\cdot \\frac{ax}{bx} \\cdot 1 = \\frac{a}{b}$$",

    "<h4>5) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin px}{\\tan qx}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Writing $\\tan qx = \\dfrac{\\sin qx}{\\cos qx}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin px}{px} \\cdot px \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\cos qx}{\\sin qx} \\times \\frac{qx}{qx}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin px}{px} \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{qx}{\\sin qx} \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\cos qx \\cdot \\frac{px}{qx}$$",
    "$$= 1 \\cdot 1 \\cdot 1 \\cdot \\frac{p}{q} = \\frac{p}{q}$$",

    "<h4>6) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{\\sin(x-a)}{x^2 - a^2}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Factoring the denominator:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{\\sin(x-a)}{(x+a)(x-a)}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{\\sin(x-a)}{(x-a)} \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{1}{x+a}$$",
    "$$= 1 \\cdot \\frac{1}{a+a} = \\frac{1}{2a}$$",

    "<h4>7) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to p} \\frac{x^2 - p^2}{\\tan(x-p)}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Factoring numerator and writing $\\tan(x-p) = \\dfrac{\\sin(x-p)}{\\cos(x-p)}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to p} (x+p)(x-p) \\times \\frac{\\cos(x-p)}{\\sin(x-p)}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to p} \\frac{(x-p)}{\\sin(x-p)} \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to p} \\cos(x-p) \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to p} (x+p)$$",
    "$$= 1 \\cdot 1 \\cdot (p+p) = 2p$$",

    "<h4>8) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin ax \\cdot \\cos bx}{\\sin cx}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Multiplying and dividing by $ax$ and $cx$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin ax}{ax} \\cdot ax \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\cos bx \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{cx}{\\sin cx} \\times \\frac{1}{cx}$$",
    "$$= 1 \\cdot \\frac{ax}{cx} \\cdot 1 \\cdot 1$$",
    "$$= \\frac{a}{c}$$",

    "<h4>9) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{1 - \\cos x}{x^2}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Using $1-\\cos x = 2\\sin^2(x/2)$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{2\\sin^2(x/2)}{x^2}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{2(\\sin(x/2))^2}{(x/2)^2} \\times \\frac{1}{4}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{1}{2} \\left( \\frac{\\sin(x/2)}{x/2} \\right)^2$$",
    "$$= \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 1^2 = \\frac{1}{2}$$",

    "<h4>10) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{1 - \\cos 6x}{x^2}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Using $1-\\cos 6x = 2\\sin^2(3x)$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{2\\sin^2(6x/2)}{x^2}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{2(\\sin 6x/2)^2}{(6x/2)^2} \\times \\frac{36}{4}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{2}{4} \\times 36 \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\left( \\frac{\\sin(6x/2)}{6x/2} \\right)^2$$",
    "$$= 18 \\cdot 1^2 = 18$$",

    "<h4>11) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{1 - \\cos 9x}{x^2}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Using $1-\\cos 9x = 2\\sin^2(9x/2)$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{2\\sin^2(9x/2)}{x^2}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{2(\\sin 9x/2)^2}{(9x/2)^2} \\times \\frac{81}{4}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{2 \\times 81}{4} \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\left( \\frac{\\sin(9x/2)}{9x/2} \\right)^2$$",
    "$$= \\frac{81}{2} \\times 1 = \\frac{81}{2}$$",

    "<h4>12) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\cos ax - \\cos bx}{x^2}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Using $\\cos ax - \\cos bx = 2\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{a+b}{2}x\\right)\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{b-a}{2}x\\right)$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{2\\sin\\left(\\frac{a+b}{2}x\\right) \\cdot \\sin\\left(\\frac{b-a}{2}x\\right)}{x^2}$$",
    "<p>Splitting and multiplying/dividing by $\\frac{a+b}{2}$ and $\\frac{b-a}{2}$:</p>",
    "$$= 2 \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin\\left(\\frac{a+b}{2}x\\right)}{\\frac{a+b}{2}x} \\cdot \\frac{a+b}{2} \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin\\left(\\frac{b-a}{2}x\\right)}{\\frac{b-a}{2}x} \\cdot \\frac{b-a}{2}$$",
    "$$= 2 \\cdot 1 \\cdot \\frac{a+b}{2} \\cdot \\frac{b-a}{2}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{1}{2}(b+a)(b-a) = \\frac{1}{2}(b^2-a^2)$$",

    "<h4>13) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin ax - \\sin bx}{x}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Splitting into two terms:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\left( \\frac{\\sin ax}{x} - \\frac{\\sin bx}{x} \\right)$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\left( \\frac{\\sin ax}{ax} \\times a - \\frac{\\sin bx}{bx} \\times b \\right)$$",
    "$$= 1 \\cdot a - 1 \\cdot b = a - b$$",

    "<h4>14) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{1 - \\cos px}{1 - \\cos qx}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Using $1-\\cos\\theta = 2\\sin^2(\\theta/2)$ for both terms:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{2\\sin^2(px/2)}{2\\sin^2(qx/2)}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\left(\\sin(px/2)\\right)^2}{\\left(\\sin(qx/2)\\right)^2}$$",
    "<p>Multiplying and dividing by $\\left(\\frac{px}{2}\\right)^2$ and $\\left(\\frac{qx}{2}\\right)^2$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\left( \\frac{\\sin(px/2)}{px/2} \\right)^2 \\times \\frac{p^2}{4} \\times \\frac{1}{\\left(\\sin(qx/2)\\right)^2} \\times \\left(\\frac{qx}{2}\\right)^2 \\times \\frac{1}{q^2}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\left( \\frac{\\sin(px/2)}{px/2} \\right)^2 \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\left( \\frac{qx/2}{\\sin(qx/2)} \\right)^2 \\cdot \\frac{p^2}{q^2}$$",
    "$$= 1^2 \\cdot 1^2 \\cdot \\frac{p^2}{q^2} = \\frac{p^2}{q^2}$$",

    "<h4>15) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\tan x - \\sin x}{x^3}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Writing $\\tan x = \\dfrac{\\sin x}{\\cos x}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\frac{\\sin x}{\\cos x} - \\sin x}{x^3}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin x (1 - \\cos x)}{x^3 \\cos x}$$",
    "<p>Using $1-\\cos x = 2\\sin^2(x/2)$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin x}{x} \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\cos x} \\cdot \\frac{2\\sin^2(x/2)}{x^2} \\times \\frac{1}{4}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin x}{x} \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{1}{\\cos x} \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\left( \\frac{\\sin(x/2)}{x/2} \\right)^2 \\times \\frac{1}{4}$$",
    "$$= 1 \\times 1 \\times 1^2 \\times \\frac{2}{4} = \\frac{1}{2}$$",

    "<h4>16) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\tan 2x - \\sin 2x}{x^3}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Writing $\\tan 2x = \\dfrac{\\sin 2x}{\\cos 2x}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin 2x (1 - \\cos 2x)}{x^3 \\cos 2x}$$",
    "<p>Using $1-\\cos 2x = 2\\sin^2 x$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin 2x}{2x} \\times 2 \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{1}{\\cos 2x} \\times \\frac{2\\sin^2 x}{x^2}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin 2x}{2x} \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{1}{\\cos 2x} \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\left( \\frac{\\sin x}{x} \\right)^2 \\times 2 \\times 2$$",
    "$$= 1 \\times 1 \\times 1^2 \\times 4 = 4$$",

    "<h4>17) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to \\pi/2} (\\sec x - \\tan x)$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Multiplying and dividing by $(\\sec x + \\tan x)$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\pi/2} \\frac{(\\sec x - \\tan x)(\\sec x + \\tan x)}{\\sec x + \\tan x}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\pi/2} \\frac{\\sec^2 x - \\tan^2 x}{\\sec x + \\tan x}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\pi/2} \\frac{1}{\\sec x + \\tan x}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{1}{\\infty + \\infty} = 0$$",

    "<h4>18) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to \\pi/4} \\frac{\\sec^2 x - 2}{\\tan x - 1}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Using $\\sec^2 x = 1 + \\tan^2 x$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\pi/4} \\frac{(1+\\tan^2 x) - 2}{\\tan x - 1}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\pi/4} \\frac{\\tan^2 x - 1}{\\tan x - 1}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\pi/4} \\frac{(\\tan x - 1)(\\tan x + 1)}{\\tan x - 1}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\pi/4} (\\tan x + 1)$$",
    "$$= 1 + 1 = 2$$",

    "<h4>19) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to \\pi/4} \\frac{2 - \\csc^2 x}{1 - \\cot x}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Using $\\csc^2 x = 1 + \\cot^2 x$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\pi/4} \\frac{2 - (1+\\cot^2 x)}{1 - \\cot x}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\pi/4} \\frac{1 - \\cot^2 x}{1 - \\cot x}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\pi/4} \\frac{(1-\\cot x)(1+\\cot x)}{1 - \\cot x}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\pi/4} (1 + \\cot x)$$",
    "$$= 1 + 1 = 2$$",

    "<h4>20) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to y} \\frac{\\tan x - \\tan y}{x - y}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Writing tangents in terms of sine and cosine:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to y} \\frac{\\frac{\\sin x}{\\cos x} - \\frac{\\sin y}{\\cos y}}{x-y}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to y} \\frac{\\sin x \\cos y - \\cos x \\sin y}{\\cos x \\cos y (x-y)}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to y} \\left\\{ \\frac{\\sin(x-y)}{(x-y)} \\times \\frac{1}{\\cos x \\cos y} \\right\\}$$",
    "$$= 1 \\times \\frac{1}{\\cos^2 y} = \\sec^2 y$$",

    "<h4>21) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to y} \\frac{\\sin x - \\sin y}{x - y}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Using $\\sin x - \\sin y = 2\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{x+y}{2}\\right)\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{x-y}{2}\\right)$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to y} \\frac{2\\cos\\left(\\frac{x+y}{2}\\right) \\cdot \\sin\\left(\\frac{x-y}{2}\\right)}{(x-y)}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to y} 2 \\cdot \\frac{\\sin(x-y)/2}{(x-y)/2 \\times 2} \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to y} \\cos\\left(\\frac{x+y}{2}\\right)$$",
    "$$= \\frac{2 \\times 1}{2} \\times \\cos\\left(\\frac{2y}{2}\\right)$$",
    "$$= \\cos y$$",

    "<h4>22) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to y} \\frac{\\cos x - \\cos y}{x - y}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Using $\\cos x - \\cos y = -2\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{x+y}{2}\\right)\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{x-y}{2}\\right)$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to y} \\frac{-2\\sin\\left(\\frac{x+y}{2}\\right) \\cdot \\sin\\left(\\frac{x-y}{2}\\right)}{(x-y)}$$",
    "$$= 2 \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to y} \\frac{\\sin(x-y)/2}{(x-y)/2 \\times 2} \\times \\lim_{x \\to y} \\sin\\left(\\frac{x+y}{2}\\right)$$",
    "$$= -2 \\times \\frac{1}{2} \\times \\sin\\left(\\frac{2y}{2}\\right)$$",
    "$$= -\\sin y$$",

    "<h4>23) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\frac{x \\cot\\theta - \\theta \\cot x}{x - \\theta}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Adding and subtracting $\\theta\\cot\\theta$ in the numerator:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\frac{x\\cot\\theta - \\theta\\cot\\theta + \\theta\\cot\\theta - \\theta\\cot x}{(x-\\theta)}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\frac{(x-\\theta)\\cot\\theta}{(x-\\theta)} + \\frac{\\theta(\\cot\\theta - \\cot x)}{(x-\\theta)}$$",
    "$$= \\cot\\theta + \\theta \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\frac{\\frac{\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta} - \\frac{\\cos x}{\\sin x}}{(x-\\theta)}$$",
    "$$= \\cot\\theta + \\theta \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\frac{\\sin x \\cos\\theta - \\cos x \\sin\\theta}{(x-\\theta) \\sin\\theta \\sin x}$$",
    "$$= \\cot\\theta + \\theta \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\frac{\\sin(x-\\theta)}{(x-\\theta)} \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\frac{1}{\\sin\\theta \\sin x}$$",
    "$$= \\cot\\theta + \\theta \\cdot 1 \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sin^2\\theta}$$",
    "$$= \\cot\\theta + \\frac{\\theta}{\\sin^2\\theta}$$",

    "<h4>24) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\frac{x\\cos\\theta - \\theta\\cos x}{x - \\theta}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Adding and subtracting $\\theta\\cos\\theta$ in the numerator:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\frac{x\\cos\\theta - \\theta\\cos\\theta + \\theta\\cos\\theta - \\theta\\cos x}{(x-\\theta)}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\left\\{ \\frac{(x-\\theta)\\cos\\theta}{(x-\\theta)} + \\frac{\\theta(\\cos\\theta - \\cos x)}{(x-\\theta)} \\right\\}$$",
    "<p>Using $\\cos\\theta - \\cos x = 2\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{\\theta+x}{2}\\right)\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{x-\\theta}{2}\\right)$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\cos\\theta + \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\theta \\cdot \\frac{2\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\theta+x}{2}\\right) \\cdot \\sin\\left(\\frac{x-\\theta}{2}\\right)}{(x-\\theta)}$$",
    "$$= \\cos\\theta + 2\\theta \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\sin\\left(\\frac{\\theta+x}{2}\\right) \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\frac{\\sin\\left(\\frac{x-\\theta}{2}\\right)}{\\frac{x-\\theta}{2}} \\times \\frac{1}{2}$$",
    "$$= \\cos\\theta + 2\\theta \\cdot \\sin\\theta \\cdot 1 \\times \\frac{1}{2}$$",
    "$$= \\cos\\theta + \\theta\\sin\\theta$$",

    "<h4>25) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{1 + \\cos \\pi x}{\\tan^2 \\pi x}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Writing $\\tan^2\\pi x = \\dfrac{\\sin^2 \\pi x}{\\cos^2 \\pi x}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{(1+\\cos \\pi x)\\cos^2 \\pi x}{\\sin^2 \\pi x}$$",
    "<p>Using $\\sin^2 \\pi x = 1 - \\cos^2 \\pi x = (1+\\cos\\pi x)(1-\\cos\\pi x)$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{(1+\\cos\\pi x)\\cos^2\\pi x}{(1+\\cos\\pi x)(1-\\cos\\pi x)}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{\\cos^2 \\pi x}{1 - \\cos \\pi x}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{(-1)^2}{1-(-1)}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{1}{2}$$",

    "<h4>26) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\frac{x \\tan\\theta - \\theta \\tan x}{x - \\theta}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Adding and subtracting $\\theta\\tan\\theta$ in the numerator:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\frac{x\\tan\\theta - \\theta\\tan\\theta + \\theta\\tan\\theta - \\theta\\tan x}{(x-\\theta)}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\frac{(x-\\theta)\\tan\\theta}{(x-\\theta)} + \\frac{\\theta(\\tan\\theta - \\tan x)}{(x-\\theta)}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\tan\\theta + \\theta \\cdot \\frac{\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta} - \\frac{\\sin x}{\\cos x}}{x-\\theta}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\tan\\theta + \\theta \\cdot \\frac{\\sin\\theta\\cos x - \\sin x \\cos\\theta}{(\\cos\\theta \\cos x)(x-\\theta)}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\tan\\theta + \\theta \\cdot \\frac{\\sin(\\theta - x)}{(x-\\theta)} \\times \\frac{1}{\\cos\\theta\\cos x}$$",
    "$$= \\tan\\theta - \\theta \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\frac{\\sin(x-\\theta)}{(x-\\theta)} \\cdot \\lim_{x \\to \\theta} \\frac{1}{\\cos\\theta\\cos x}$$",
    "$$= \\tan\\theta - \\theta \\cdot 1 \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\cos^2\\theta}$$",
    "$$= \\tan\\theta - \\theta \\sec^2\\theta$$",

    "<h4>27) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{\\theta \\to \\pi/4} \\frac{\\cos\\theta - \\sin\\theta}{\\theta - \\pi/4}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Multiplying and dividing by $\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{\\theta \\to \\pi/4} \\frac{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\cos\\theta - \\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\sin\\theta}{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}(\\theta - \\pi/4)}$$",
    "<p>Recognizing $\\sin(\\pi/4) = \\cos(\\pi/4) = 1/\\sqrt2$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{\\theta \\to \\pi/4} \\frac{\\sin(\\pi/4)\\cos\\theta - \\cos(\\pi/4)\\sin\\theta}{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}(\\theta - \\pi/4)}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{\\theta \\to \\pi/4} \\frac{\\sin(\\pi/4 - \\theta)}{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}(\\theta - \\pi/4)}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{\\theta \\to \\pi/4} \\frac{-\\sin(\\theta - \\pi/4)}{(\\theta - \\pi/4)} \\times \\sqrt2$$",
    "$$= -\\sqrt2 \\times 1 = -\\sqrt2$$",

    "<h4>28) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to c} \\frac{\\sqrt{x} - \\sqrt{c}}{\\sin x - \\sin c}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Multiplying numerator and denominator by the conjugate $\\sqrt{x}+\\sqrt{c}$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to c} \\frac{x - c}{(\\sin x - \\sin c)} \\times \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}+\\sqrt{c}}$$",
    "<p>Using $\\sin x - \\sin c = 2\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{x-c}{2}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{x+c}{2}\\right)$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to c} \\frac{(x-c)}{2\\sin\\left(\\frac{x-c}{2}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{x+c}{2}\\right)} \\times \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}+\\sqrt{c}}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to c} \\frac{(x-c)/2}{\\sin\\left(\\frac{x-c}{2}\\right)} \\times 2 \\times \\frac{1}{\\cos\\left(\\frac{x+c}{2}\\right)} \\times \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}+\\sqrt{c}}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{2}{2} \\times \\frac{1}{\\cos c} \\times \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{c}+\\sqrt{c}}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{c}} \\times \\sec c = \\frac{\\sec c}{2\\sqrt{c}}$$",

    "<h3>29) Find the limits of</h3>",

    "<h4>a) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{e^{6x} - 1}{x}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Multiplying and dividing by $6$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{e^{6x} - 1}{6x} \\times 6$$",
    "$$= 1 \\times 6 = 6$$",

    "<h4>b) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{e^{2x} - 1}{x \\cdot 2^{x+1}}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Multiplying and dividing by $2$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{e^{2x} - 1}{2x} \\times 2 \\times \\frac{1}{2^{x+1}}$$",
    "$$= 1 \\times 2 \\times \\frac{1}{2^1}$$",
    "$$= \\frac{2}{2} = 1$$",

    "<h4>c) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{e^{ax} - e^{bx}}{x}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Splitting into two standard limits by adding and subtracting $1$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{e^{ax} - 1}{x} - \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{e^{bx} - 1}{x}$$",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{e^{ax} - 1}{ax} \\times a - \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{e^{bx} - 1}{bx} \\times b$$",
    "$$= 1 \\cdot a - 1 \\cdot b = a - b$$",

    "<h4>d) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{a^x + b^x - 2}{x}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Splitting into two standard limits by adding and subtracting $1$ and $1$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{a^x - 1}{x} + \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{b^x - 1}{x}$$",
    "$$= \\log a + \\log b$$",
    "$$= \\log(ab)$$",

    "<h3>30) Evaluate the limits of</h3>",

    "<h4>a) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{x-2}{\\log(x-1)}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Writing $\\log(x-1) = \\log((x-2)+1)$ to use the standard limit:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to 2} \\frac{x-2}{\\log((x-2)+1)}$$",
    "$$= 1$$",

    "<h4>b) Proof</h4>",
    "$$\\lim_{x \\to \\pi/2} \\frac{\\cos x}{\\log\\left(x - \\frac{\\pi}{2} + 1\\right)}$$",
    "<p><b>Solution:</b> Multiplying and dividing by $\\left(x-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\pi/2} \\frac{x - \\pi/2}{\\log\\left(x-\\pi/2+1\\right)} \\times \\frac{\\cos x}{x-\\pi/2}$$",
    "<p>Writing $\\cos x = \\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-x\\right) = -\\sin\\left(x-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$:</p>",
    "$$= \\lim_{x \\to \\pi/2} \\frac{(x-\\pi/2)}{\\log(x-\\pi/2+1)} \\times \\lim_{x \\to \\pi/2} \\frac{-\\sin(x-\\pi/2)}{(x-\\pi/2)}$$",
    "$$= 1 \\times (-1)$$",
    "$$= -1$$"
  ]
}
